    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_109> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_109_condition_0_9c5bdbca_role_8517855ffc> a dznorm:Role ;
