    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_160> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_160_condition_2_23006553> a dznorm:Condition ;
