    dznorm:conditionText "وإن تعذر القبض على المتهم"@ar ;
    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_196> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_196_condition_0_df06bddf_role_f218afd750> a dznorm:Role ;
