    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_201> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_201_obligation_0_55f0b7f0_role_992d50354a> a dznorm:Role ;
