    dznorm:conditionText "و خلال المداولة"@ar ;
    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_443> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_443_condition_0_d5c550c8_period_14ba0915be> a dznorm:Period ;
