    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_582> .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_583_condition_0_2048c3ce> a dznorm:Condition ;
    dzdoc:hasReference <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_583_condition_0_2048c3ce_ref_eb3d212a104d> ;
