    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_841> ;
    dznorm:position 2 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_841_condition_3_14e55d50> a dznorm:Condition ;
