<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_855_condition_0_a4ff2ca6> a dznorm:Condition ;
    dzdoc:hasReference <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_855_condition_0_a4ff2ca6_ref_ca18f0a7126c> ;
