    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_885> ;
    dznorm:position 1 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_885_obligation_0_47703d3f> a dznorm:Obligation ;
