        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_656>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_660>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_661>,
        <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2025-08-03/25-14#art_662>,
